TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium with fixed O2(g), allow goethite + gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7   10
    Pyrite   0     0.1
    Goethite 0     10
    Gypsum   0     10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Fe3_aq_species_count
    10 PUNCH SUM(SYS("Fe(3)"))
END
